   tops with its own floor texture, a little darker (`FP_CEILING_SHADE`). Off by default;
-  **F10** or F1 > Display > Ceilings in first person turns them on (`fp_ceilings` in
+  **F10** or F1 > Forbs Hidden Mods > Ceilings in first person turns them on (`fp_ceilings` in
